{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1301440-multiple-attacks-and-venomous-attacks","id":1301440,"title":"Multiple attacks and venomous attacks?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-31T15:58:17-07:00","id":1301440,"title":"Multiple attacks and venomous attacks?","content":"Hello all, I was just thinking about how multiple attack charms work with poison due to a Lunar thread I have been reading. So if you have a duration 8 poison that does -2 penalty and 2 initiative per round its in place, and attack with a multiple attack charm such as Octopus and Spider Barrage, so if both attacks hit the foe has to take multiple difficulty 8 resistance checks and what ever is left on those are added together as a duration so even very resistant people with a 10 dice resistance roll are likely to have 6 rounds of poison?<br /> <br /> This just seems really nasty to me?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-31T19:57:23-07:00","id":1301496,"title":"","content":"There's a couple of limiting factors on poison you might not be considering. First, bear in mind that poison only takes effect on a successful decisive hit. Obviously, this isn't a factor for Octopus-and-Spider Barrage, which is decisive, but it does mean that multiple withering attacks won't be laying poison down. Also, if you're hitting someone with multiple decisive attacks, it's probably good odds that you're really intending to just kill them, so the exact duration of the poison is actually not that relevant.<br /> <br /> Second, poison is a resource, whether it's something purchased with resources, or a charm effect. If it's something you purchased or even made yourself, then after each attack, you have to reapply the poison. That's an action, and the dose of poison might well cost more than you like - something like Yozi venom could easily be costing something like Resources 4 or 5 a dose, or simply be unpurchasable, only available through specific quests or the like. And if it's a charm-created poison, each dose of poison will generally cost motes separately. Remember, multiple-attack charms, unless they say otherwise, don't automatically let you apply charms to all the attacks without paying for all those charms. If you use Octopus-and-Spider Barrage and make 4 attacks, and use Adder Fang Method to envenom all those, you've just spent 12m, <i>on top</i> of the 8m, 1wp just to activate Octopus-and-Spider Barrage. Sure, the target will probably be poisoned for a while. Is that worth burning half your mote pool? Maybe not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-31T22:14:47-07:00","id":1301514,"title":"","content":"I also believe that a poisoned weapon needs to be re-poisoned every time it applies the poison, which normally stops that kind of thing from being an issue. If you can somehow make it so that every attack has a strong poison, and have a decisive multiattack, then yeah, it's really really nasty. You could launch a very low initiative attack flurry and still kill almost anything.<br /> <br /> The only defense at that point are if you have enough hardness to block the attacks, unless they ignore hardness of course, or to just have a focused exalt level of resistance to poison. Hopefully applying poisons that are that hard to resist is not an easy thing to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T06:09:37-07:00","id":1301596,"title":"","content":"I suppose if you are a naturally venemous creature like a Black Mamba or a wasp or you have a natural weapon that is venemous, then you won't have to re-apply it after each attack, you just have a set reservoir of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T06:26:27-07:00","id":1301603,"title":"","content":"Good catches for all of this Kelly, although I don't think the resource expense is as big a thing as you expect. Lunars are likely going to be getting the mutation upgrades for toxin sacs making it stamina in uses before they even need to spend motes, and even if they don't the charm used to create the venom is not that expensive only 3 motes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T07:47:27-07:00","id":1301623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Citadel97501</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1301440-multiple-attacks-and-venomous-attacks?p=1301603#post1301603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good catches for all of this Kelly, although I don't think the resource expense is as big a thing as you expect. Lunars are likely going to be getting the mutation upgrades for toxin sacs making it stamina in uses before they even need to spend motes, and even if they don't the charm used to create the venom is not that expensive only 3 motes.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> (Stamina) doses of venom per day isn't actually all that much, even if you regenerate one if you're out when you start a fight. I would very much have to consider the use of poisoning someone for a long time by using up basically all my doses with Octopus-and-Spider Barrage. Do I want to only have one dose ready if we get into a second fight in the same day? And, as I said, Adder Fang Method is 3 motes, yes, <i>per attack</i>. That adds up, especially when you're doing a bunch of attacks all at once.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:16:42-07:00","id":1301652,"title":"","content":"Also, the poison on Adder Fang Method is not nearly as powerful as the one in the OP's example. It's Duration is 5 at most.<br /> <br /> Though I think actually the most effective use of multiple-attack charms with poison is with an animal form that has a naturally poisonous attack. That way no resource is used up by the poison. And at high essence, you can use Adder Fang on each attack (expensive, but worth it) to get massive durations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T10:26:04-07:00","id":1301680,"title":"","content":"There are also charms that make it easier to resist the poison effect, but not all of them have charms. Also in the case of the Solars have charm to become completely immune to any poison that does not kill them, so a type of poison could only affect them once only if they have that charm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25189-dagurasu","name":"Dagurasu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T14:51:07-07:00","id":1301729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1301440-multiple-attacks-and-venomous-attacks?p=1301652#post1301652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, the poison on Adder Fang Method is not nearly as powerful as the one in the OP's example. It's Duration is 5 at most.<br /> <br /> Though I think actually the most effective use of multiple-attack charms with poison is with an animal form that has a naturally poisonous attack. That way no resource is used up by the poison. And at high essence, you can use Adder Fang on each attack (expensive, but worth it) to get massive durations.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Adder Fang Method specifically allows you to use the poison of one of your forms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T15:11:15-07:00","id":1301731,"title":"","content":"True, I guess wasp poison has duration 6, but it's only 1i a round.<br /> <br /> Everything else is 5 at most (and most are less).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}